{
      "name": "BFS — 01 Ingestion",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "parameters": {
            "content": "## BFS — 01 Ingestion\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow starts manually when executing it.\n2. It retrieves documents without embeddings from Supabase.\n3. The documents are processed in batches.\n4. Each document batch's embedding is generated using OpenAI API.\n5. The generated embedding is saved back to Supabase.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Ensure access to Supabase database with necessary permissions.\n- [ ] Obtain and configure access to the OpenAI API for embedding generation.\n- [ ] Validate that the correct table and fields are specified in the Supabase node.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can adjust the batch size in the 'Loop Over Items' node to optimize processing time and resource usage.",
            "width": 480,
            "height": 672
          },
          "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            -608,
            -128
